Imagine a website has a comments feature.

```text
User
 ↓
Comment
 ↓
Database
 ↓
Comments page
 ↓
Browser
```

If comments are stored and later rendered as executable HTML/script instead of safely encoded text:

> **Stored XSS may occur.**

