# 34. REFLECTED XSS SCENARIO

A search page receives:

```text
Search term
```

The server places the search term directly into the response without safe encoding.

```text
Request
   ↓
Server
   ↓
Response containing unsafe input
   ↓
Browser
```

This may create reflected XSS.

---

# 35. DOM XSS SCENARIO

A page contains client-side code that reads a URL value and inserts it into the DOM using an unsafe HTML sink.

```text
URL
 ↓
JavaScript
 ↓
Unsafe DOM operation
 ↓
Browser
```

This is a typical DOM-based XSS pattern.

